{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45426","headline":"圣恩顾问独游月磴阁直书其事应制 · 广宣","name":"圣恩顾问独游月磴阁直书其事应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禅居河畔无多地，来往寻春物正华。\n磴道上盘千亩竹，栏干低压万人家。\n檐前施饭来飞鸟，林下行香踏落花。\n自解刹那知佛性，不劳更喻几尘沙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"广宣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45426.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45426","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}